   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Pasado",
    "@en": "Past"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para algo que ya pasó se usa **-았/었다면서요**: 갔다면서요 (¿no dijiste que fuiste?).",
     "@en": "For something that has already happened it is used **-았/었다면서요**: 갔다면서요 (didn't you say you were?)"
